#: ../../source/users/element/collection/create_element.rst:5
msgid "Create element"
msgstr "创建元件"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/create_element.rst:7
msgid ""
"Working with collections can only be done from the collections panel. Before"
" starting to work with collections, the collections panel has to be "
"displayed."
msgstr "集合的相关操作只能在集合面板中进行。在开始使用集合之前，必须先显示集合面板。"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/create_element.rst:12
msgid ""
"Select **Settings > Display > Collections** menu item to display the "
"Collections panel."
msgstr "选择 **设置 > 显示 > 集合** 菜单项以显示集合面板。"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/create_element.rst:14
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows creating element at some collection. The user has only "
"read rights at QET element collection, the user can create element at all "
"collections except QET collection."
msgstr ""
"QElectroTech 允许在某个集合中创建元件。用户对 QET 元件集合只有读取权限，因此除了 QET 集合之外，用户可以在其他所有集合中创建元件。"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/create_element.rst:17
msgid ""
"There is two different ways to create a new element at the user collection. "
"A new element can be created from cero or from an already existing element "
"from the QET or user collection."
msgstr "在用户集合中创建新元件有两种方式：从零开始创建，或基于 QET 集合或用户集合中已有的元件创建。"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/create_element.rst:21
msgid "Create element from cero"
msgstr "从零开始创建元件"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/create_element.rst:23
msgid ""
"Right click on the user collection or at the category / sub-category from "
"the collection where the new element should be added."
msgstr "右键单击用户集合，或右键单击集合中要添加新元件的类别/子类别。"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/create_element.rst:28
msgid "Figure: Options at folder"
msgstr "图：文件夹上的选项"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/create_element.rst:30
msgid "Click the option **New element** to start the element creation."
msgstr "单击 **新建元件** 选项，开始创建元件。"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/create_element.rst:31
msgid "Confirm or change the category from the element."
msgstr "确认或更改元件所属的类别。"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/create_element.rst:36
msgid "Figure: Category election PopUp window"
msgstr "图：类别选择弹出窗口"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/create_element.rst:39
msgid "Define the element file name."
msgstr "定义元件文件名。"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/create_element.rst:44
msgid "Figure: File name definition PopUp window"
msgstr "图：文件名定义弹出窗口"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/create_element.rst:46
msgid ""
"Define the element name for the collection and project tree. It can be "
"defined in many languages."
msgstr "定义集合和项目树中显示的元件名称。该名称可以用多种语言定义。"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/create_element.rst:51
msgid "Figure: Element name definition PopUp window"
msgstr "图：元件名称定义弹出窗口"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/create_element.rst:55
msgid ""
"QElectroTech works according `ISO 639-1`_ norm. The element name language is"
" defined using 2 letter code which should be used at the language column "
"from the folder internal name table."
msgstr ""
"QElectroTech 遵循 `ISO 639-1`_ 规范。元件名称的语言使用两位字母代码定义，该代码应填写在文件夹内部名称表的语言列中。"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/create_element.rst:60
msgid ""
"Once the element editor PopUp window is opened, design the symbol element "
"and define the properties."
msgstr "打开元件编辑器弹出窗口后，设计符号元件并定义其属性。"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/create_element.rst:61
msgid "Save the element and it will appear at the collection."
msgstr "保存元件，它便会显示在集合中。"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/create_element.rst:65
msgid ""
"For more information about the element editor, refer to `Element editor "
"<../../../en/element/elementeditor/index.html>`_ section."
msgstr ""
"有关元件编辑器的更多信息，请参阅 `元件编辑器 <../../../en/element/elementeditor/index.html>`_ 一节。"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/create_element.rst:68
msgid "Create an element from an existing element"
msgstr "基于现有元件创建元件"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/create_element.rst:70
msgid ""
"Right click on the element which will be used as base for the new element."
msgstr "右键单击要用作新元件基础的元件。"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/create_element.rst:75
msgid "Figure: Options at element"
msgstr "图：元件上的选项"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/create_element.rst:77
msgid ""
"Click the option **Edit element** to open the element at the element editor."
msgstr "单击 **编辑元件** 选项，在元件编辑器中打开该元件。"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/create_element.rst:78
msgid "Select **File > Save as** menu item to open the save window."
msgstr "选择 **文件 > 另存为** 菜单项以打开保存窗口。"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/create_element.rst:83
msgid "Figure: Element editor File menu"
msgstr "图：元件编辑器的文件菜单"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/create_element.rst:85
msgid "Choose the element category at the collection tree."
msgstr "在集合树中选择元件类别。"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/create_element.rst:86
msgid "Define the file name for the element."
msgstr "定义元件的文件名。"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/create_element.rst:87
msgid "Press the button **Save**."
msgstr "单击 **保存** 按钮。"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/create_element.rst:92
msgid "Figure: Element editor Save as PopUp window"
msgstr "图：元件编辑器另存为弹出窗口"
